# AI Architecture

## Overview

The Multi-tenant Hotel Booking Platform is a software development project aimed at building a scalable and secure hotel booking system. The platform will allow multiple hotels to be managed and booked by different users, with each hotel having its own set of features and functionalities.

## Confirmed Current Architecture

* FastAPI backend
* Python
* SQLAlchemy database layer
* Agent Registry
* REST API
* Ollama local AI integration
* Model Router
* Project memory/workspace system

## Confirmed AI Engine

* Provider: Ollama
* Endpoint: http://127.0.0.1:11434
* Confirmed available models include:
